        "title": {
          "en": "OpenAI Launches Agents API for Cloud Agent Development",
          "zh": "OpenAI 推出 Agents API 以支持云代理开发"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "OpenAI introduced the Agents API, a managed service designed for building and launching cloud agents.",
          "zh": "OpenAI 推出了 Agents API，这是一项专为构建和启动云代理而设计的托管服务。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "The Agents API operates as a managed service.",
            "It leverages the Codex harness for its core functionality.",
            "Key capabilities include orchestration, long-running sessions, and tool use."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Agents API 作为一项托管服务运行。",
            "它利用 Codex harness 提供核心功能。",
            "主要功能包括编排、长时间会话和工具使用。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "The introduction of the Agents API offers a managed service solution for developing and deploying cloud agents. This provides a structured platform for AI agent functionalities like orchestration and tool use, potentially streamlining development efforts in agentic AI applications.",
          "zh": "Agents API 的推出为开发和部署云代理提供了一个托管服务解决方案。这为人工智能代理功能（如编排和工具使用）提供了一个结构化平台，有望简化代理式人工智能应用的开发工作。"
        },
        "source": "OpenAI News",
        "link": "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/agents-api/overview"
      },
      {
        "title": {
